[[0,1853914,0,25,0,25,"2017-05-11T18:32:00","EavanSmith","",[],"","Eight Arab princesses go on trial in Belgium","http://www.dw.com/en/eight-arab-princesses-go-on-trial-in-belgium/a-38796246","news"],[1,9076866,0,4,0,4,"2017-05-11T19:28:26","hypercat","",[],"<p>I hope they get prosecuted to the highest extent. I am sick of them getting special rights because of money and power. </p>"],[1,9077366,0,0,0,0,"2017-05-11T20:13:30","DrShitlord","",[],"<p>Headline reads like the introduction to a really great joke.</p>"],[1,9077390,0,2,0,2,"2017-05-11T20:16:06","optionalfrank","",[],"<p>A friend was telling me how when she was living in a university residence (more expensive kind with maids doing the cleaning), a girl from a noble family from the middle east was almost kicked out. She kept verbally abusing and slapping the otherwise well paid and normal white maid. For her it must have been normal to abuse maids back home, but here unfortunately we are not savages.</p>"],[1,9078095,0,0,0,0,"2017-05-11T21:15:46","cousineerie","",[],"<p>Arab Princess? I think they are called Pig Lickers in my country.</p>"],[1,9084093,0,0,0,0,"2017-05-12T10:31:09","J_Darnley","",[],"<blockquote>\n<p>But it took nine years for the actual trial to get underway.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Christ. I'm surprised that the charges haven't lapsed (statute of limitations in common law). Belgians are famous for dragging cases out so much that they escape prosecution. Catholic church sex crimes and diamond trading are the two big ones I think of.</p>"],[1,9084745,0,0,0,0,"2017-05-12T14:45:50","Darwinxmachina","",[],"<p>These Arab nobles consider every other human on the planet a subspecies when in fact they're so unevolved by their financial insulation as to actually be less human and less adaptable than most. Evolution demands adaptation. A nuanced character trait that will hopefully phase out these devolving inbreds. </p>"]]
